{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":38544280,"ns":0,"title":"Ballast","extract":"Ballast is dense material used as a weight to provide stability to a vehicle or structure. Ballast, other than cargo, may be placed in a vehicle, often a ship or the gondola of a balloon or airship, to provide stability.","description":"Material that is used to provide stability to a vehicle or structure","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}